**Formula Used:**

Average = frac{{Sum of the observation}}{{Total observation}}

**Calculations:**

The sum of all 7 article marked price is

⇒ Sum = 1100 + 700 + 900 + 600 + 400 + 500 + 1000 = 5200

According to the formula,

⇒ Average = frac{{Sum of the observation}}{{Total observation}}

⇒ Average = frac{{5200}}{{7}}

⇒ Average = 742.85

**⇒ ****Hence, The average price of all 7 articles marked price is 742.85**
